Subject: [PATCH 03/14] Cloud Dialer: provider chooser on call (VoIP +
 deep-link + cellular)

New startCallWithProviderChooser() shows a RadioGroupDialog of Cellular + each available
provider (VoIP in-app call when the contact has a call row, else deep-link open). Wired to
the dialpad call button; falls through to plain cellular when no provider applies.
